{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2021-03-22 22:51:00', 'title': 'SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ANNOUNCES PRICING OF OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., MARCH 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ("SVB") (NASDAQ:\xa0SIVB), ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF ITS UNDERWRITTEN PUBLIC OFFERING OF 2,000,000 SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK AT A PRICE TO THE PUBLIC OF $500.00 PER SHARE FOR EXPECTED GROSS PROCEEDS OF APPROXIMATELY $1,000,000,000 BEFORE UNDERWRITING DISCOUNTS AND COMMISSIONS AND OFFERING EXPENSES.'}